WEBVTT - Video-Compression Launch Film & Overview

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Dropping a 4K raw video into Discord triggers the 1.00 GB upload rejection modal.

00:03.500 --> 00:07.500
Even with Nitro, clips hit hard ceilings across all Discord tiers: 20 MB, 50 MB, 100 MB, and 1 GB.

00:07.500 --> 00:11.000
Cloud compression tools fail with slow upload queues, daily conversion limits, and file size traps.

00:11.000 --> 00:15.000
Manual FFmpeg commands require guesswork. Video-Compression is 100% offline, local, and free.

00:15.000 --> 00:17.500
Introducing Video-Compression: automatic size budgeting with zero manual configuration.

00:17.500 --> 00:20.500
Target exact Discord presets (20MB, 50MB, 100MB, 1024MB) or any arbitrary custom file size.

00:20.500 --> 00:23.500
Zero-setup workflow: simply drag and drop your video onto the target standalone executable.

00:23.500 --> 00:26.500
Automated hardware detection selects the fastest GPU encoder with zero manual flags.

00:26.500 --> 00:29.000
Standard 120+ MB distributions with 40+ loose DLLs are eliminated.

00:29.000 --> 00:32.000
Self-contained 18 to 32 MB standalone executables bundle micro-FFmpeg with zero dependencies.

00:32.000 --> 00:35.000
Pure zero-copy GPU dataflow: decoding, scaling, and encoding execute entirely within VRAM.

00:35.000 --> 00:38.000
Zero host CPU memory transfers eliminate system bus bottlenecks.

00:38.000 --> 00:43.000
Smart split point analysis divides workloads across a dual-worker Rich TUI parallel pipeline.

00:43.000 --> 00:48.000
Verified benchmark: 603.9 FPS encoding throughput (10.07x real-time) with 88% less CPU overhead.

00:48.000 --> 00:55.000
Real-time moving slider comparison on fast-motion 1080p60 gameplay.

00:55.000 --> 01:03.000
Crystal-clear motion preserved at 33.70 dB PSNR: 479 MB compressed down to 97 MB (4.9:1 ratio).

01:03.000 --> 01:10.000
4K60 UHD fidelity comparison: massive 1.93 GB master reduced to 98.5 MB.

01:10.000 --> 01:18.000
19.7:1 compression ratio (-94.9% size reduction) with zero macroblocking on fine details.

01:18.000 --> 01:22.000
The compressed clip uploads instantly to Discord and plays inline. Drop. Compress. Share.

01:22.000 --> 01:26.500
Get standalone executables for Windows, Linux, and macOS on GitHub Releases. 100% free under GPL-3.0.
